		comment
			product.js is loaded from here and ONLY here. sections/main-product.liquid
			used to emit it as well, so on a product page the browser executed the
			file twice and bound every listener twice.

			It has to load from this position rather than from the section: the
			libraries above are synchronous, so a deferred tag here runs after them,
			whereas the section's tag sits earlier in the document and would run
			before gsap exists — product.js feature-detects gsap in a constructor and
			would silently disable the sticky add-to-cart animation.
		endcomment
		if template.name == 'product'
			assign add_product_js = true
